273
00:45:44,682 --> 00:45:47,185
Itu jebakan. Jebakan

274
00:45:51,271 --> 00:45:52,314
Tunggu, Tuan Muda...

275
00:46:13,874 --> 00:46:14,834
Ibu...

276
00:46:15,918 --> 00:46:17,044
Ibu...

277
00:46:17,878 --> 00:46:19,004
Ibu!

278
00:46:20,172 --> 00:46:20,965
Ib...

279
