Semoga perjalananmu lancar, Prajurit...

313
00:49:59,076 --> 00:50:00,536
Jangan aku juga!

314
00:50:03,955 --> 00:50:05,999
Jangan aku!

315
00:52:24,497 --> 00:52:28,459
