316
00:53:01,280 --> 00:53:03,032
Ayo! Ayo!

317
00:53:03,574 --> 00:53:04,825
Ayo kita makan!

318
00:53:05,076 --> 00:53:06,077
Ayo!

319
00:53:10,080 --> 00:53:12,623
Ayo! Ayo makan!

320
00:53:12,916 --> 00:53:13,917
