Tunggu. Hei, Tuan!

432
01:12:36,413 --> 01:12:38,499
Bocah kecil sombong!

433
01:12:48,257 --> 01:12:49,592
Kau akan menguburnya...?

434
01:13:06,106 --> 01:13:06,982
Tarik sekarang!

435
01:13:07,149 --> 01:13:08,984
Aku penurut sekali

436
01:13:09,109 --> 01:13:10,152
Berhenti!

437
01:13:10,861 --> 01:13:13,238
Terlalu jauh! Kembali

438
01:13:14,406 --> 01:13:15,407
Cukup

439
01:13:18,284 --> 01:13:19,869
Aku tak sanggup menerima ini

440
01:13:20,953 --> 01:13:23,747
Jangan salahkan aku jika Natsuko dimakan

441
01:13:24,248 --> 01:13:26,958
Katamu kau akan makan jantungku

442
01:13:32,713 --> 01:13:33,714
Maaf...

443
01:13:34,006 --> 01:13:35,174
Aduh!

444
01:13:38,093 --> 01:13:40,929
Katakan. Di mana Natsuko?!

445
