446
01:13:43,890 --> 01:13:46,517
Coba saja! Akan kucabik-cabik kau!

447
01:13:48,311 --> 01:13:52,022
Aduh! Kumohon, hentikan!

448
01:13:52,273 --> 01:13:54,817
Kau baik-baik saja? Aku
hanya menyobeknya sedikit

449
